[
    {
        "start": 0,
        "stop": 1.28,
        "text": " Alright, let's just jump right"
    },
    {
        "start": 1.28,
        "stop": 2.8,
        "text": " in. For what feels like forever"
    },
    {
        "start": 2.8,
        "stop": 4.11,
        "text": ", we've been treating AI like"
    },
    {
        "start": 4.11,
        "stop": 4.4,
        "text": " this"
    },
    {
        "start": 4.4,
        "stop": 6.32,
        "text": " unexplainable black box, right?"
    },
    {
        "start": 6.32,
        "stop": 7.61,
        "text": " You ask it something, you get"
    },
    {
        "start": 7.61,
        "stop": 9.24,
        "text": " an answer. But the how behind"
    },
    {
        "start": 9.24,
        "stop": 11.15,
        "text": " it all? That's a total mystery."
    },
    {
        "start": 11.15,
        "stop": 12.4,
        "text": " Well, today we're going to"
    },
    {
        "start": 12.4,
        "stop": 13.52,
        "text": " crack that box wide open by"
    },
    {
        "start": 13.52,
        "stop": 14.36,
        "text": " looking at a"
    },
    {
        "start": 14.36,
        "stop": 15.6,
        "text": " new kind of architecture, one"
    },
    {
        "start": 15.6,
        "stop": 16.69,
        "text": " that's actually built on an"
    },
    {
        "start": 16.69,
        "stop": 18.32,
        "text": " idea that's 50 years old. It's"
    },
    {
        "start": 18.32,
        "stop": 18.48,
        "text": " called"
    },
    {
        "start": 18.48,
        "stop": 20.01,
        "text": " procedural memory, and it"
    },
    {
        "start": 20.01,
        "stop": 21.75,
        "text": " basically forces AI to show its"
    },
    {
        "start": 21.75,
        "stop": 23.55,
        "text": " work. And this, right here,"
    },
    {
        "start": 23.55,
        "stop": 24.26,
        "text": " gets to the"
    },
    {
        "start": 24.26,
        "stop": 25.73,
        "text": " absolute heart of it. We're all"
    },
    {
        "start": 25.73,
        "stop": 27.05,
        "text": " used to the equation on top."
    },
    {
        "start": 27.05,
        "stop": 28.62,
        "text": " That's standard algebra. It's"
    },
    {
        "start": 28.62,
        "stop": 28.9,
        "text": " intuitive"
    },
    {
        "start": 28.9,
        "stop": 30.82,
        "text": " for us humans. But look at the"
    },
    {
        "start": 30.82,
        "stop": 32.32,
        "text": " one on the bottom. That's"
    },
    {
        "start": 32.32,
        "stop": 34.36,
        "text": " called reverse Polish notation,"
    },
    {
        "start": 34.36,
        "stop": 34.94,
        "text": " or RPN."
    },
    {
        "start": 34.94,
        "stop": 36.36,
        "text": " You might remember it from old"
    },
    {
        "start": 36.36,
        "stop": 38.1,
        "text": " school HP calculators. It looks"
    },
    {
        "start": 38.1,
        "stop": 39.74,
        "text": " weird, but for a computer, it's"
    },
    {
        "start": 39.74,
        "stop": 40.42,
        "text": " incredibly"
    },
    {
        "start": 40.42,
        "stop": 42.25,
        "text": " efficient. And more importantly"
    },
    {
        "start": 42.25,
        "stop": 43.58,
        "text": ", it's explicit, and you can"
    },
    {
        "start": 43.58,
        "stop": 45.2,
        "text": " actually debug it. This strange"
    },
    {
        "start": 45.2,
        "stop": 45.74,
        "text": "-looking"
    },
    {
        "start": 45.74,
        "stop": 47.66,
        "text": " logic? It's the key to a more"
    },
    {
        "start": 47.66,
        "stop": 49.53,
        "text": " transparent, and frankly, more"
    },
    {
        "start": 49.53,
        "stop": 51.43,
        "text": " powerful AI. So that really is"
    },
    {
        "start": 51.43,
        "stop": 51.74,
        "text": " the"
    },
    {
        "start": 51.74,
        "stop": 53.12,
        "text": " big question for this whole"
    },
    {
        "start": 53.12,
        "stop": 54.9,
        "text": " explainer. Why on earth are we"
    },
    {
        "start": 54.9,
        "stop": 56.29,
        "text": " looking back at calculator"
    },
    {
        "start": 56.29,
        "stop": 57.74,
        "text": " logic from the 1970s"
    },
    {
        "start": 57.74,
        "stop": 59.16,
        "text": " to solve some of the biggest,"
    },
    {
        "start": 59.16,
        "stop": 60.45,
        "text": " most pressing problems in"
    },
    {
        "start": 60.45,
        "stop": 62.29,
        "text": " artificial intelligence today?"
    },
    {
        "start": 62.29,
        "stop": 63.12,
        "text": " Well, the answer is"
    },
    {
        "start": 63.12,
        "stop": 64.12,
        "text": " surprisingly elegant,"
    },
    {
        "start": 64.12,
        "stop": 66.04,
        "text": " and it has some truly massive"
    },
    {
        "start": 66.04,
        "stop": 67.34,
        "text": " implications. So here's our"
    },
    {
        "start": 67.34,
        "stop": 69.14,
        "text": " game plan. First, we're going"
    },
    {
        "start": 69.14,
        "stop": 70.36,
        "text": " to tackle what's called the"
    },
    {
        "start": 70.36,
        "stop": 71.83,
        "text": " dead brain problem that plagues"
    },
    {
        "start": 71.83,
        "stop": 73.42,
        "text": " current AI. Then, we'll dive"
    },
    {
        "start": 73.42,
        "stop": 75.31,
        "text": " into the solution, the living"
    },
    {
        "start": 75.31,
        "stop": 76.95,
        "text": " stack. After that, we'll break"
    },
    {
        "start": 76.95,
        "stop": 77.95,
        "text": " down the three-brain"
    },
    {
        "start": 77.95,
        "stop": 79.34,
        "text": " architecture and its super"
    },
    {
        "start": 79.34,
        "stop": 80.81,
        "text": " efficient GPU engine. And"
    },
    {
        "start": 80.81,
        "stop": 82.45,
        "text": " finally, we'll see how this all"
    },
    {
        "start": 82.45,
        "stop": 83.5,
        "text": " adds up to a new kind of"
    },
    {
        "start": 83.5,
        "stop": 85.31,
        "text": " intelligence, one that doesn't"
    },
    {
        "start": 85.31,
        "stop": 87.08,
        "text": " come with all the insane bloat."
    },
    {
        "start": 87.08,
        "stop": 89.46,
        "text": " Okay. First up, the dead brain"
    },
    {
        "start": 89.46,
        "stop": 91.67,
        "text": " problem. This really gets to"
    },
    {
        "start": 91.67,
        "stop": 93.46,
        "text": " the core of what's wrong with"
    },
    {
        "start": 93.46,
        "stop": 94.71,
        "text": " So many of the AI systems we"
    },
    {
        "start": 94.71,
        "stop": 96.27,
        "text": " use today. They're basically"
    },
    {
        "start": 96.27,
        "stop": 97.83,
        "text": " impossible to look inside, and"
    },
    {
        "start": 97.83,
        "stop": 99.47,
        "text": " they are incredibly inefficient"
    },
    {
        "start": 99.47,
        "stop": 99.84,
        "text": "."
    },
    {
        "start": 99.84,
        "stop": 101.76,
        "text": " Yeah, this slide lays it out"
    },
    {
        "start": 101.76,
        "stop": 103.39,
        "text": " perfectly. On the one hand, you"
    },
    {
        "start": 103.39,
        "stop": 105.21,
        "text": " have the current AI paradigm."
    },
    {
        "start": 105.21,
        "stop": 106.88,
        "text": " It's like the AI is just saying"
    },
    {
        "start": 106.88,
        "stop": 108.8,
        "text": ", \"Trust me, I ran the numbers."
    },
    {
        "start": 108.8,
        "stop": 110.36,
        "text": " It's a black box.\" But the"
    },
    {
        "start": 110.36,
        "stop": 111.02,
        "text": " problem with that is on the"
    },
    {
        "start": 111.02,
        "stop": 111.6,
        "text": " right. These systems are opaque"
    },
    {
        "start": 111.6,
        "stop": 112.24,
        "text": ", so you can't debug them. And"
    },
    {
        "start": 112.24,
        "stop": 112.87,
        "text": " they have this huge knowledge"
    },
    {
        "start": 112.87,
        "stop": 113.53,
        "text": " duplication crisis, where the"
    },
    {
        "start": 113.53,
        "stop": 114.17,
        "text": " same pieces of information are"
    },
    {
        "start": 114.17,
        "stop": 114.85,
        "text": " stored over and over again. All"
    },
    {
        "start": 114.85,
        "stop": 115.46,
        "text": " that leads to bloated,"
    },
    {
        "start": 115.46,
        "stop": 116.07,
        "text": " inefficient, and risky models."
    },
    {
        "start": 116.07,
        "stop": 116.68,
        "text": " That's the dead brain problem"
    },
    {
        "start": 116.68,
        "stop": 117.34,
        "text": " in a nutshell. So if that's the"
    },
    {
        "start": 117.34,
        "stop": 118.22,
        "text": " problem, what's the fix?"
    },
    {
        "start": 118.22,
        "stop": 119.34,
        "text": " Well, the source calls it the"
    },
    {
        "start": 119.34,
        "stop": 120.28,
        "text": " living stack. And this"
    },
    {
        "start": 120.28,
        "stop": 121.41,
        "text": " introduces us to a really core"
    },
    {
        "start": 121.41,
        "stop": 122.5,
        "text": " concept: procedural memory"
    },
    {
        "start": 122.5,
        "stop": 123.86,
        "text": " knowledge representation, or PM"
    },
    {
        "start": 123.86,
        "stop": 124.6,
        "text": "KR for short."
    },
    {
        "start": 124.6,
        "stop": 126.09,
        "text": " That's the deadbrain problem in"
    },
    {
        "start": 126.09,
        "stop": 127.76,
        "text": " a nutshell. So if that's the"
    },
    {
        "start": 127.76,
        "stop": 130.13,
        "text": " problem, what's the fix? Well,"
    },
    {
        "start": 130.13,
        "stop": 132.02,
        "text": " the source calls it the living"
    },
    {
        "start": 132.02,
        "stop": 133.4,
        "text": " stack. And this introduces us"
    },
    {
        "start": 133.4,
        "stop": 134.86,
        "text": " to a really core concept,"
    },
    {
        "start": 134.86,
        "stop": 136.79,
        "text": " procedural memory knowledge"
    },
    {
        "start": 136.79,
        "stop": 138.69,
        "text": " representation, or PMKR for"
    },
    {
        "start": 138.69,
        "stop": 140.79,
        "text": " short. Okay, this is the"
    },
    {
        "start": 140.79,
        "stop": 141.32,
        "text": " crucial"
    },
    {
        "start": 141.32,
        "stop": 143.12,
        "text": " difference. Think about it like"
    },
    {
        "start": 143.12,
        "stop": 144.19,
        "text": " this. Instead of storing a"
    },
    {
        "start": 144.19,
        "stop": 145.51,
        "text": " million photos of a finished"
    },
    {
        "start": 145.51,
        "stop": 145.94,
        "text": " cake,"
    },
    {
        "start": 145.94,
        "stop": 147.94,
        "text": " PMKR just stores the recipe for"
    },
    {
        "start": 147.94,
        "stop": 150.03,
        "text": " the cake once. That recipe is a"
    },
    {
        "start": 150.03,
        "stop": 152.41,
        "text": " procedure, right? It's an"
    },
    {
        "start": 152.41,
        "stop": 153.88,
        "text": " executable program. You can run"
    },
    {
        "start": 153.88,
        "stop": 155.15,
        "text": " it whenever you want to get the"
    },
    {
        "start": 155.15,
        "stop": 156.36,
        "text": " cake. You can look at every"
    },
    {
        "start": 156.36,
        "stop": 156.82,
        "text": " single"
    },
    {
        "start": 156.82,
        "stop": 158.33,
        "text": " step. You can even tweak the"
    },
    {
        "start": 158.33,
        "stop": 160.06,
        "text": " ingredients. The knowledge isn"
    },
    {
        "start": 160.06,
        "stop": 161.8,
        "text": "'t some static dead object. It's"
    },
    {
        "start": 161.8,
        "stop": 161.94,
        "text": " a"
    },
    {
        "start": 161.94,
        "stop": 163.86,
        "text": " living, breathing, executable"
    },
    {
        "start": 163.86,
        "stop": 165.29,
        "text": " process. And here's where it"
    },
    {
        "start": 165.29,
        "stop": 166.93,
        "text": " gets really clever. It's this"
    },
    {
        "start": 166.93,
        "stop": 167.48,
        "text": " idea of a"
    },
    {
        "start": 167.48,
        "stop": 169.4,
        "text": " dual client contract. You have"
    },
    {
        "start": 169.4,
        "stop": 170.99,
        "text": " one single source of truth for"
    },
    {
        "start": 170.99,
        "stop": 172.8,
        "text": " a piece of knowledge. For us,"
    },
    {
        "start": 172.8,
        "stop": 173.36,
        "text": " the human"
    },
    {
        "start": 173.36,
        "stop": 175.28,
        "text": " client, it gets rendered into"
    },
    {
        "start": 175.28,
        "stop": 176.25,
        "text": " something we can easily"
    },
    {
        "start": 176.25,
        "stop": 178.01,
        "text": " understand, like a 3D model or"
    },
    {
        "start": 178.01,
        "stop": 178.82,
        "text": " a normal math"
    },
    {
        "start": 178.82,
        "stop": 180.8,
        "text": " equation. But for the AI client"
    },
    {
        "start": 180.8,
        "stop": 182.43,
        "text": ", that exact same source of"
    },
    {
        "start": 182.43,
        "stop": 184.52,
        "text": " truth is an executable program,"
    },
    {
        "start": 184.52,
        "stop": 185.2,
        "text": " like those"
    },
    {
        "start": 185.2,
        "stop": 187.12,
        "text": " RPN operations we saw. You get"
    },
    {
        "start": 187.12,
        "stop": 188.81,
        "text": " two views, but there's only one"
    },
    {
        "start": 188.81,
        "stop": 190.84,
        "text": " underlying source. No conflicts"
    },
    {
        "start": 190.84,
        "stop": 191.16,
        "text": " and"
    },
    {
        "start": 191.16,
        "stop": 193.19,
        "text": " absolutely no duplication. So"
    },
    {
        "start": 193.19,
        "stop": 195.01,
        "text": " how does this actually work in"
    },
    {
        "start": 195.01,
        "stop": 197.12,
        "text": " practice? Well, that brings us"
    },
    {
        "start": 197.12,
        "stop": 197.96,
        "text": " to K3D."
    },
    {
        "start": 197.96,
        "stop": 198.8,
        "text": " It's the reference"
    },
    {
        "start": 198.8,
        "stop": 200.13,
        "text": " implementation of this whole"
    },
    {
        "start": 200.13,
        "stop": 201.53,
        "text": " procedural memory idea, and it"
    },
    {
        "start": 201.53,
        "stop": 202.4,
        "text": "'s built on what's"
    },
    {
        "start": 202.4,
        "stop": 203.39,
        "text": " called a three-brain"
    },
    {
        "start": 203.39,
        "stop": 204.96,
        "text": " architecture. The architecture"
    },
    {
        "start": 204.96,
        "stop": 206.12,
        "text": " is really elegant because it"
    },
    {
        "start": 206.12,
        "stop": 207.1,
        "text": " kind of mirrors how a"
    },
    {
        "start": 207.1,
        "stop": 208.84,
        "text": " computer's memory already works"
    },
    {
        "start": 208.84,
        "stop": 210.3,
        "text": ". You've got the house, which is"
    },
    {
        "start": 210.3,
        "stop": 212.08,
        "text": " like your SSD or hard drive. It"
    },
    {
        "start": 212.08,
        "stop": 212.52,
        "text": "'s for"
    },
    {
        "start": 212.52,
        "stop": 213.72,
        "text": " the long-term persistent"
    },
    {
        "start": 213.72,
        "stop": 215.13,
        "text": " storage of all those recipes or"
    },
    {
        "start": 215.13,
        "stop": 216.76,
        "text": " procedural programs. Then there"
    },
    {
        "start": 216.76,
        "stop": 218.04,
        "text": "'s the galaxy, which"
    },
    {
        "start": 218.04,
        "stop": 219.34,
        "text": " you can think of as your VRAM."
    },
    {
        "start": 219.34,
        "stop": 220.66,
        "text": " It's the active 3D workspace"
    },
    {
        "start": 220.66,
        "stop": 221.98,
        "text": " where knowledge gets loaded up"
    },
    {
        "start": 221.98,
        "stop": 222.72,
        "text": " for real-time"
    },
    {
        "start": 222.72,
        "stop": 224.19,
        "text": " reasoning. And finally, you"
    },
    {
        "start": 224.19,
        "stop": 225.61,
        "text": " have the cranium. That's the"
    },
    {
        "start": 225.61,
        "stop": 227.03,
        "text": " GPU itself, the actual engine"
    },
    {
        "start": 227.03,
        "stop": 227.74,
        "text": " that does the"
    },
    {
        "start": 227.74,
        "stop": 229.13,
        "text": " thinking and executes the"
    },
    {
        "start": 229.13,
        "stop": 230.96,
        "text": " programs. It's a really clean,"
    },
    {
        "start": 230.96,
        "stop": 232.73,
        "text": " logical system. Now let's zoom"
    },
    {
        "start": 232.73,
        "stop": 233.76,
        "text": " in on the heart of"
    },
    {
        "start": 233.76,
        "stop": 235.61,
        "text": " that cranium, the engine that"
    },
    {
        "start": 235.61,
        "stop": 236.92,
        "text": " makes this whole thing tick."
    },
    {
        "start": 236.92,
        "stop": 238.68,
        "text": " This is where that 50-year-old"
    },
    {
        "start": 238.68,
        "stop": 239.64,
        "text": " calculator logic"
    },
    {
        "start": 239.64,
        "stop": 241.62,
        "text": " comes roaring back to life. So"
    },
    {
        "start": 241.62,
        "stop": 243.78,
        "text": " why use reverse polish notation"
    },
    {
        "start": 243.78,
        "stop": 246.5,
        "text": " on a cutting-edge GPU? Well, it"
    },
    {
        "start": 246.5,
        "stop": 246.78,
        "text": " turns out"
    },
    {
        "start": 246.78,
        "stop": 248.08,
        "text": " to be a perfect marriage."
    },
    {
        "start": 248.08,
        "stop": 249.63,
        "text": " Because every single operation"
    },
    {
        "start": 249.63,
        "stop": 251.05,
        "text": " is explicit and visible on the"
    },
    {
        "start": 251.05,
        "stop": 252.38,
        "text": " stack, the whole process"
    },
    {
        "start": 252.38,
        "stop": 253.75,
        "text": " is completely transparent and"
    },
    {
        "start": 253.75,
        "stop": 255.23,
        "text": " debuggable. Stack operations"
    },
    {
        "start": 255.23,
        "stop": 256.6,
        "text": " are also incredibly efficient"
    },
    {
        "start": 256.6,
        "stop": 256.98,
        "text": " for the"
    },
    {
        "start": 256.98,
        "stop": 258.1,
        "text": " way GPUs process things in"
    },
    {
        "start": 258.1,
        "stop": 259.64,
        "text": " parallel. It's deterministic,"
    },
    {
        "start": 259.64,
        "stop": 260.94,
        "text": " meaning the same input always"
    },
    {
        "start": 260.94,
        "stop": 261.7,
        "text": " gives you the same"
    },
    {
        "start": 261.7,
        "stop": 263.23,
        "text": " output, which is a huge deal."
    },
    {
        "start": 263.23,
        "stop": 264.86,
        "text": " And maybe the wildest part, the"
    },
    {
        "start": 264.86,
        "stop": 266.49,
        "text": " core engine is just 2.3 kilob"
    },
    {
        "start": 266.49,
        "stop": 267.58,
        "text": "ytes. You can"
    },
    {
        "start": 267.58,
        "stop": 268.79,
